cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code in your research, please cite the thesis."
title: "Transformer-based modelling of human glia-to-PV interneuron reprogramming"
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Xing
    name: "Xing"
repository-code: "https://github.com/sc_transformer/pv_reprogramming"
abstract: >
  Reusable research code for Transformer-based modelling of human glia-to-PV
  interneurone reprogramming.  The framework combines fate classification,
  latent-time trajectory forecasting, model attribution, and in silico
  perturbation to prioritise candidate regulators of PV-associated fate
  acquisition.
keywords:
  - single-cell
  - transformer
  - reprogramming
  - glia-to-neuron
  - perturbation
  - gene-regulatory-network
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-05-19"
